references/upstream is an unmodified source/documentation snapshot for comparison.
The local implementation is newly written unless its file header identifies a
ported utility. PyTRIO code in the reference snapshot is never imported or run.
Upstream reported benchmark results are NOT results of this local reproduction.
Dataset and paper rights remain with their respective authors; see docs/DATA.md.

The explicitly ported local utilities are:
  src/agentic_rl/agentopsd.py
  src/agentic_rl/alfworld_data.py
  src/agentic_rl/alfworld_env.py
Their provenance headers are retained. ALFWorld skill prompt files copied by
scripts/prepare_environments.py also retain the reference project's provenance.
The new Chinese tutorials and conceptual illustrations are separately authored
for this project. Generated-asset hashes are in docs/assets/algorithms/manifest.json.
The continuous-control implementations in src/agentic_rl/embodied are locally
written educational implementations of SAC, TD3, HER and IQL mechanisms.
See docs/CODE_PROVENANCE.md for attribution.

Basic LLM contains separately supplied technical-report reading materials.
DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash report text, figures and original-page images are attributed
to DeepSeek-AI. Chinese translation, commentary and document tools were imported
from user-supplied materials; they are not claimed as new original work of this
repository. See the model directory README.md and manifest.json for attribution,
file mapping and changes. The repository license does not relicense third-party
paper content or figures.

